  <entry>
    <title>AI Agent 很强，但它会“越跑越偏”</title>
    <link href="https://blog.janus-path.com/2026/03/25/AI%20Agent%20%E5%BE%88%E5%BC%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%AE%83%E4%BC%9A%E2%80%9C%E8%B6%8A%E8%B7%91%E8%B6%8A%E5%81%8F%E2%80%9D/"/>
